			// the playing surface is centered with the baskets exactly on the rims. So the
			// sprite needs no per-image calibration — one fixed transform fits every image.
			// Returns true on success; false (file missing/bad) → procedural fallback.
			async function drawCourtFromImage(variant, homePaint, awayPaint) {
